# Learn to Play: lesson 1 (Match the Ends) by its steps — select 4|6, play it
# on the right end cap, the guide answers, pass with S — to its outro, then
# the next lesson (The Boneyard): draw with W, play the drawn 3|6 on the
# left end cap.
until 300 Chain Dominoes
frames 20
click Learn to Play
until 60 Six short lessons
frames 10
click Start
until 200 Step 1 of 3
frames 30
save lesson1
click 4 | 6 domino
frames 10
click Play selected tile on right end
until 300 Step 3 of 3
frames 30
key KeyS 2
until 300 Match the Ends — complete
frames 30
save lesson1-done
click Next lesson
until 200 Step 1 of 5
frames 30
key KeyW 2
until 200 Step 2 of 5
frames 20
click 3 | 6 domino
frames 10
click Play selected tile on left end
until 300 Step 3 of 5
frames 10
save lesson2
